      "preBlockScreens": [
        "Let's practice the DRT.\nIgnore the conveyor and focus only on the red border signal.\n\nPress SPACEBAR as quickly as possible whenever the border flashes red.\n\nThis block will end after 60 seconds.\n\nWe recommend resting your finger on the SPACEBAR so you can press it quickly without moving your hand.\n\nIn the following block there will be two rounds."
      ],
      "afterBlockScreens": [
        {
          "html": "<div style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.45;'>Great job!<p><img src='assets/evander-bricks/sprite/boxy_with_coin.png' alt='Boxy With Coin' style='max-height: 120px; height: 100%; width: auto;'/></p><p>We will now do some practice trials putting both tasks together. Use your mouse to click the highlighted box and complete the memory task, and rest a finger from the other hand on the SPACEBAR. Press the SPACEBAR whenever you see the red border flash, as quickly as you can while still opening the boxes.</p><p>It might feel a little tricky to do both tasks at first, but we will have several rounds of practice to familiarise you with the responses. Boxy believes in you!</p></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Practice2",
      "phase": "practice",
      "trials": 2,
      "manipulations": [
        "difficulty_practice2",
        "condition_plan"
      ],
      "overrides": {
        "surveys": {
          "postTrial": []
        }
      },
      "afterBlockScreens": [
        {
          "html": "<div style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.45;'>Well done!<p><img src='assets/evander-bricks/sprite/boxy_point.png' alt='Boxy Pointing' style='max-height: 120px; height: 100%; width: auto;'/></p><p>From here on you will always complete both the detection task and the conveyor task. The conveyor will change speeds between blocks and sometimes it will be difficult to open all the boxes. Click highlighted boxes to start memory tasks; correct memory responses shrink boxes. Please try your best to open as many boxes as you can within the time limit!</p><p>Remember: Opening boxes gives you coins, but boxes being destroyed results in coins being taken away!</p></div>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<div style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.45;'>After each round, you will also be asked to rate some aspects of your workload and performance on the task. Please carefully read each question, as they ask different things. We encourage you to use the full scale range as the experiment progresses.</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
