          {
            "html": "<div style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.45; style='text-align:center; margin-bottom:12px''>DO NOT CLOSE THIS WINDOW!<p><img src='assets/evander-bricks/break_images/finish_screen.png' style='max-width: 300px; width: 100%; height: auto; image-rendering:pixelated'></p><p>Congratulations! Your final coin balance is: {experimentPoints}.</p><p>Across the experiment you opened {blockCleared} boxes, and only let {blockDropped} boxes be destroyed. Boxy and his family are very happy.</p><p>You have now completed the experiment. Thank you very much for participating. Please read the debrief form on the next screen, then click Continue. The experiment will redirect to SONA and automatically apply your credits.</p><p>Do not close the window until you see a message from SONA that your credits have been awarded!</p>"
